# Control-channel script for this app's net row (sim-run.sh::run_test; hil-run
# skips rows with one): the app fetches on its own once the screen is up, so
# wait for the forecast to land, turn the pages once each (A twice: week,
# details), then Y — BACK with nothing to dismiss finishes the Activity and
# ends the row the way a term row does.
wait Weather[]:] updated
sleep 1
input keyevent 20
sleep 1
input keyevent 20
sleep 1
input back
